wns, peaks, lakes and cantons with key figures\n\u2013 Hiking trails and SchweizMobil routes when zoomed in\n\u2013 German and English\n\nTerrain, aerial imagery, place names, borders and hiking trails come from official swisstopo data (\u00a9 swisstopo). Hiking routes come from SchweizMobil (Federal Roads Office, cantons, SchweizMobil).\n\nRequires hand tracking.", "short_description": "Switzerland as a 3D relief model in front of you. Explore the terrain, towns, peaks, lakes, cantons and hiking trails, built from official swisstopo data (\u00a9 swisstopo). Hand tracking only."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://timestep.studio/privacy_policy_switzerlandvr.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Timestep Studio", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://timestep.studio/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "726368587961803"}, {"id": "1043107547362485"}, {"id": "514087707868786"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "de"], "supported_input_devices": ["HAND_TRACKING"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "2059301984740670"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823746_1793965408894988_6657759749575785237_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=4UwIv3O1Y6oQ7kNvwEcXfd4&_nc_oc=AdpPTMaCjl8KKm5nG0GAzEbjv3x72cgr2I0aR56xnmJmyOviw1i5Q0S9Z6ovMh5bHoo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_